WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.793
- SO YOU GOT TO KEEP
THE TOPPINGS FULL.

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.754
- OKAY, GOT IT.
I'M ON TOP OF THAT.

00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:04.963
- YOU GONNA FIT IN
JUST FINE HERE.

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:07.549
HEY, SOMEDAY...

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.426
THAT MIGHT BE YOUR PICTURE
ON THE WALL.

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:12.346
- OH, EMPLOYEE OF THE YEAR.

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:13.764
WHEN DOES SHE WORK?

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:15.140
- WHAT?

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.268
- I WAS JUST WONDERING
WHEN SHE WORKS.

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:22.356
- GIRL, IT'S ME.

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:25.025
- OH...

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.194
CONGRATS.

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:29.863
- NOW, HERE'S THE BEST PART
ABOUT WORKING AT A YOGURT SHOP,

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.490
IS YOU GET
ALL THE FREE FROYO YOU WANT.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.783
MM-HMM.

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.826
AND YOU CAN'T BELIEVE
HOW DELICIOUS IT IS

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:35.869
AND ALSO FAT FREE.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.829
THANK GOD,
BECAUSE MY BOYFRIEND--

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:39.873
HE JUST GOT BACK
FROM HIS TOUR IN AFGHANISTAN,

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.917
AND HE'S COMING HERE
TO PICK ME UP.

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:45.545
HE SHOULD BE HERE IN A MINUTE.
I HAVEN'T SEEN HIM IN A YEAR.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.214
- A WHOLE YEAR, YOU SAY.

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:50.217
- MM-HMM. HAVE SOME.

00:00:50.217 --> 00:00:52.177
- I'M GOOD.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.263
- NOW, IF YOU NEED A EXTRA SHIRT
OR ANYTHING,

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:56.765
THEY GONNA BE IN THERE,
BECAUSE THESE SEEM TO SHRINK.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.016
- UH-HUH.
- OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT, GIRL?

00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:00.060
I CAN'T GET ENOUGH
OF THIS STUFF.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.937
I MEAN, YOU SHOULD HAVE SOME.
IT'S FREE.

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:05.232
- NO, I'M OKAY.
I'M--I'LL HAVE SOME LATER.

00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:07.693
- COME ON, GIRL, IT'S FAT FREE.

00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:12.531
- HI. I JUST GOT BACK
FROM AFGHANISTAN.

00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:13.991
I'M HERE LOOKING
FOR MY GIRLFRIEND, LATIA.

00:01:13.991 --> 00:01:15.492
- AAH!

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.994
BABY!

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.789
BABY, WHAT--WHAT?
IT'S ME.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:22.541
- NO, IT'S NOT.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:25.961
- WHAT? IT'S ME.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.546
- APPARENTLY SHE DOESN'T WORK
HERE ANYMORE.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.131
THANKS.

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:31.758
- WHAT?

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:35.178
OH, MY GOD!
HE'S LEAVING ME!

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:38.307
DESMONA, IS HE LEAVING ME?
DESMONA, WHY WOULD HE LEAVE ME?

00:01:38.307 --> 00:01:42.352
WHAT--WHAT POSSIBLE REASON COULD
THERE BE FOR HIM LEAVING ME?

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:45.147
FOR HIM LEAVING ME?

00:01:45.147 --> 00:01:48.066
- MAYBE HE--
MAYBE HE GOT THAT PSD. PSD.

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:50.944
- WHAT? OH, YOU MEAN THE PTSDs?
- THE PTSDs.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:54.281
- YOU MEAN THE POST-TRAUMATIC
STRESS DISORDER.

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:56.325
[crying]
IT'S GOT TO BE THAT.

00:01:56.325 --> 00:02:00.245
OH, MY GOD!
MY BABY GOT THE PTSD!

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:01.872
MY BABY GOT THE PTSD!

00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:05.250
THAT COULD BE THE ONLY REASON!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.252
OH, MY BABY!

00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:11.214
MY POOR, POOR BABY
GOT THE PTSDs!

00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:13.550
OH, MY BABY!

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:16.678
[wailing]

